{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggin' Around is a\u00a0<strong>FROG-TABULOUS,\u00a0</strong>two player, co-op\u00a0only experience.<strong>\ud83d\udc38</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two <strong>FROGS</strong>\u00a0on a magical quest.\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together and use your <strong>FROG POWERS\u00a0</strong>to progress and solve puzzles through this colorful fantasy world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embody a frog \ud83d\udc38</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl around, stretch your tongue,  croak and eat flies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006090/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.poster.avif?t=1762393813\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006090/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.webm?t=1762393813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006090/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.mp4?t=1762393813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate \ud83e\udd1d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with your partner to solve clever puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006090/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.poster.avif?t=1762393813\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006090/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.webm?t=1762393813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006090/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.mp4?t=1762393813